sequenceDiagram
    participant RAIL as Railway
    participant DOCKER as Docker container
    participant OC as openclaw agent
    participant GIT as git branch<br/>market-ldr-data
    participant TG as Telegram

    Note over RAIL,GIT: Container start
    RAIL->>DOCKER: spin up
    DOCKER->>GIT: git fetch market-ldr-data
    GIT-->>DOCKER: memory/ + MEMORY.md
    DOCKER->>OC: start gateway
    OC-->>TG: ready, idle

    Note over OC,TG: Working session
    TG->>OC: "сделай сценарий S18"
    OC->>OC: read knowledge base + memory
    OC-->>TG: scenario output
    TG->>OC: "да, одобрен"
    OC->>OC: write memory/winning-patterns.md
    OC-->>TG: записан, готов к след

    Note over RAIL,GIT: Deploy / restart
    RAIL->>DOCKER: SIGTERM (deploy main)
    DOCKER->>OC: trap SIGTERM
    OC->>GIT: git add memory/ MEMORY.md
    OC->>GIT: git commit + push
    GIT-->>OC: ok
    DOCKER->>RAIL: graceful shutdown

    Note over RAIL,GIT: New container starts → memory restored
